function [gm, re, cbar] = default_field()
%DEFAULT_FIELD  The default field's normalised zonal C(n, 0) = -Jn/sqrt(2n + 1) (grav.defaultField), degrees 2 to 6 of a 7 x 7
%   row-major matrix with C(0, 0) = 1; its GM [m^3/s^2] and radius [m].
%   returns gm: real[1] (passed a plain number)
